# --- data caches (raw downloads; normalized intel IS committed — see below) ---
# backend/data/normalized/*.json is committed deliberately: the demo estate and the whole
# test suite read it through VulnerabilityStore, so without it the app cannot build offline
# and CI would fail. It is only 320 KB and is deterministic, which is the whole point.
# Only the raw download cache is excluded.
backend/data/cache/
*.json.gz

# --- agent working state (private; not part of the project) ---
.commandcode/
MEMORY.md
SESSION.md
backend/.hypothesis/
frontend/AGENTS.md
frontend/CLAUDE.md

